    "ID": 1007440791,
    "key": "8ea3ea1378dc37ed11bd2cbee8d000acd5217e0958e9c96e024d0642944bdbd3",
    "original": "Why did I even start... (End Campaign)",
    "translation": "我当初到底是图什么……（结束战役）",
    "stage": 1,
